                                "sense_id": "9ae96912-14b2-3306-a85f-d6eec5b20caa",
                                "text": "\"Besides, if you get, you'll never be able to hold it down — a sloomy gal like you.\"\nThe applicant was only too much afraid that it must be so. She had very little confidence in herself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "683898d2-00e0-4940-9e16-c9dd7a7efdc6",
                                "sense_id": "9ae96912-14b2-3306-a85f-d6eec5b20caa",
                                "text": "[…] we would gladly soodle a sloomy way home with a burred moon over us and the fern-owls chittering in the pingles and the holts."
                            },
